// Reports & export screen (رپورٹ و ایکسپورٹ).
//
// CSV exports are generated by pure functions in export_service.dart;
// the PDF farm report and party receipts are rendered from real Flutter
// widgets captured as images (pdf_report_service.dart) so Urdu shaping
// is exactly as correct as on screen.
